{"4631500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GHOSTFLIPPERS", "steam_appid": 4631500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOST FLIPPERS</strong> is a co-op horror game where you and your crew buy haunted houses, renovate them, and sell them for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every two in-game days, your agency has bills to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a payment...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts, raid haunted warehouses for materials, renovate just enough to turn a profit, and move on to the next property.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the house, the bigger the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the haunting, the bigger the problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > BUY HAUNTED HOUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase haunted properties of different sizes and danger levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small suburban homes to abandoned apartment complexes and massive estates, every property offers greater rewards—and greater risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/3cdb1219756e864dfad1a5636d8fb9e2.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/3cdb1219756e864dfad1a5636d8fb9e2.webm?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/3cdb1219756e864dfad1a5636d8fb9e2.mp4?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RAID HAUNTED WAREHOUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building materials aren't free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into abandoned warehouses to steal furniture, appliances, and supplies before whatever is inside finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring everything back alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/abcca997d432b3ea0cfe2391a53235da.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" aria-label=\"Steal Supplies at your local furnishing store\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/abcca997d432b3ea0cfe2391a53235da.webm?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/abcca997d432b3ea0cfe2391a53235da.mp4?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RENOVATE &amp; SELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase its market value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you improve a property, the more money you'll make when it's time to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/724a840dcee97674b68a28ef55202b3c.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/724a840dcee97674b68a28ef55202b3c.webm?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/724a840dcee97674b68a28ef55202b3c.mp4?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR BUSINESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to expand your real estate agency.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase agency upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on larger, more profitable contracts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don't forget...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your bills are due. You do not want them to foreclose on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/88f9627dd331fa9575ad12296f17c968.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/88f9627dd331fa9575ad12296f17c968.webm?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/88f9627dd331fa9575ad12296f17c968.mp4?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RISK VS REWARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe with smaller contracts for steady income...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or gamble everything on a property haunted by something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/29649f3506fbd8a2353e6f9fe6a3ffff.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/29649f3506fbd8a2353e6f9fe6a3ffff.webm?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/29649f3506fbd8a2353e6f9fe6a3ffff.mp4?t=1787755846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, renovate, and sell haunted properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ghost types with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent agency progression and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property value system based on your renovations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The market is terrifying.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ghosts are worse.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOST FLIPPERS</strong> is a co-op horror game where you and your crew buy haunted houses, renovate them, and sell them for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every two in-game days, your agency has bills to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a payment...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's game over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts, raid haunted warehouses for materials, renovate just enough to turn a profit, and move on to the next property.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the house, the bigger the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the haunting, the bigger the problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > BUY HAUNTED HOUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase haunted properties of different sizes and danger levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small suburban homes to abandoned apartment complexes and massive estates, every property offers greater rewards—and greater risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/3cdb1219756e864dfad1a5636d8fb9e2.poster.avif?t=1787755846\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631500/extras/3cdb1219756e864dfad1a5636d8